DTSTART:20261107T194500Z
DTEND:20261107T214000Z
DTSTAMP:20261107T194500Z
UID:Ov7j9te4jU
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 100 mins (1h40m)\n\nSeattle Turkish Film Festival T
 he STFFShorts Program is part of STFF: The Seattle Turkish Film Festival\,
  celebrating short films across all genres. Now in its 13th year\, STFFSho
 rts presents a curated selection of 12 short films\, chosen from over 200 
 submissions\, screened over two separate showtimes as Narrative Selection 
 1 & 2\, offering exceptional filmmakers international exposure and the opp
 ortunity to connect with Northwest audiences. This screening is for STFFSh
 orts Narrative Selection 1. For more details\, please visit our website at
  stff.org/stff-shorts.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-
 turkish-film-festival-2026/stffshorts-narrative-selection-1\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 12:00
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
