 ominated for the Grand Jury Prize at Slamdance Film Festival\, Dump of Unt
 itled Pieces is a 2025 black-and-white comedy drama depicting the adventur
 es of two young adults as they try to navigate Istanbul's art world.\n\nht
 tps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle-turkish-film-festival-2026/s
 eattle-turkish-film-festival-dump-of-untitled-pieces\n\nEstimated start: 1
 3:45
