UID:SdfTbvHldu
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 107 mins (1h47m)\n\nSeattle Turkish Film Festival W
 inner of Best Actress (Istanbul Film Festival)\, nominated for a Golden Ga
 te Award (San Francisco International Film Festival) and Golden Tulip for 
 Best Film (Istanbul Film Festival)\, Those Who Whistle After Dark is about
  an existential crisis.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/seattle
 -turkish-film-festival-2026/seattle-turkish-film-festival-those-who-whistl
 e-after-dark\n\nEstimated start: 16:00
